<title>JAPAN: Arc Land Sakamoto -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Arc Land Sakamoto -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 20, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 22.08		vs	   18.16</p>
<p> Operating	  821    million	  vs	  686    million</p>
<p> Current	    972    million	  vs	  812    million</p>
<p> Net		  476    million	  vs	  420    million</p>
<p> EPS		   26.96 yen	  vs	   28.97 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     19 million	  vs	  15 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Arc Land Sakamoto Co Ltd is a wholesaler of DIY goods and retailer of household products.</p>
